**********Source Check**********

The claim 'MV _Liberty Star_ also performed something.' is supported by the citation.
<accept> The content explicitly states, "It also performed tugboat duties and acted as a research platform," and later elaborates that it "has since 1998 been used to tow the Space Shuttle external fuel tanks" and "has also occasionally been used to support scientific research operations." These statements confirm that the MV _Liberty Star_ performed additional tasks beyond its primary function. </accept>

**********Source Check**********

The claim 'MV _Liberty Star_ has been used to tow something since 1998.' is supported by the citation.
<accept> The text explicitly states: "As well as recovering the Space Shuttle, SRB's _Liberty Star_ has since 1998 been used to tow the Space Shuttle external fuel tanks from their assembly plant at Michoud Assembly Facility near New Orleans, Louisiana, to the Vehicle Assembly Building at the Kennedy Space Center in Florida." </accept>

